WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.071
Today we will represent a place through organised sounds. Our work connects with

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.195
other Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:09.444
List three sounds heard in the chosen setting.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:14.212
Assign each sound to a gentle vocal or body action.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:19.734
Perform the sounds in order to represent morning, afternoon or evening. Compare your

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:22.265
result with a second example from Ghana.
